This deliberately long card catches clipping, line length, spacing, and the
relationship between decoration and selection.

## A small table

| Stock | Surface | Feeling |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Paper | fibrous | settled |
| Post-it | bright | immediate |
| Plain | quiet | dependable |

## A code sample

```ts
const stock = theme.choose({ card: "long-form", fallback: "plain" });
renderCard({ stock, preserveSelection: true });
```

The end of the card is intentionally far from its beginning. A theme should
make the whole sheet comfortable to read on a narrow screen too.

